New CONSUMER_PATTERNS rows, each with a lowercase gate and a one-line comment naming framework + language:
`@KafkaListener(` Kafka ["springframework.kafka","kafka"] Keyed(["topics","topicpattern"]);
`@RabbitListener(` RabbitMQ ["springframework.amqp","rabbit"] Keyed(["queues","value"]);
`@JmsListener(` Jms ["jms"] Keyed(["destination"]);
`@SqsListener(` Sqs ["awspring","sqs"] KeyedOrArg(["value","queuenames"]);
