- `package.json` / `composer.json` -> `serde_json::from_str::<serde_json::Value>(text).ok()?.get("name")?.as_str()`
- `go.mod` -> first `module <x>` line (same logic as engine's `read_go_module_prefix`)
- `Cargo.toml` -> first `name = "..."` after a `[package]` header (stop at the next `[`)
- `pyproject.toml` -> first `name = "..."` after `[project]` or `[tool.poetry]`
- `pom.xml` -> first `<artifactId>…</artifactId>` that is NOT inside a `<parent>…</parent>` block (track a depth flag while scanning lines)
